| Multi-language support (Hindi, regional Indian languages, Arabic, French) | Future — Phase 1 is English-only |
| Geographies beyond India | Future — Phase 1 covers India only (all states and UTs) |
| Direct API filing with government portals (EPFO, ESIC, Income Tax) | Future — Phase 2 generates portal-upload files only; direct API filing depends on portal availability |
