### 3.7.6 M17 Assets & IT — Operational Roles

The §3.7.2 matrix row 'Assets & IT (M17)' governs the HR-side personas (Employee V own · L1 Manager V team · HRBP V assigned · HR Admin V). The IT-side operational roles below are entity-scoped operational roles (§3.3) carrying the capability flags in §3.10. L1 Manager reportee-ticket visibility is V (team).

| **Operational role** | **Scope** | **Module access** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| IT Admin / IT Asset Manager | Entity | Asset master, assignment, provisioning requests, masters, lifecycle transitions, tag re-issue, bulk import — Edit |
| Service Desk Agent | Queue | Tickets in assigned queue — Edit; resolution notes; state transitions |
| Service Desk Lead | Queue | Queue + ticket Edit/Approve; CMDB Edit; post-mortem draft |
| Service Desk Admin | Entity | Catalog items, KB authoring, SD config (categories/queues/SLA/escalation) — Edit; IT Grievance visibility |
| Finance Admin | Entity | Capitalisation/write-off booking; joint sign-off on manual write-off and Written-Off reversal |
| CTO / IT Director | Entity | Post-mortem review/sign-off; audit-exception escalation target |
| CISO / InfoSec Lead | Entity | Security-category ticket bypass; security-adjacent post-mortem input |

## 3.8 Sensitive Data Restrictions

System-enforced restrictions subject to PII protection ceilings. Exceptions are explicitly noted.

| **Data category** | **Permitted access** | **Restricted from** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Salary / CTC | Employee (own) · HR Admin · Finance Admin (view only for budgeting) | All manager tiers · HOD · UAG Head · HRBP · Recruiter · Recruitment Admin · Office Admin. HOD and UAG Head compensation visibility configurable per user by Org Admin — off by default. |
| Bank account details | Employee (own, masked) · HR Admin · Office Admin (entry only) · Payroll processing at runtime (Phase 2) | All other roles. Masked to last 4 digits for all display contexts. |
| Government IDs (PAN, Aadhaar, Passport, Driving Licence) | Employee (own, masked) · HR Admin · Office Admin (view and upload) | All other roles. Office Admin grant is platform-level and fixed — not configurable upward or downward. Changes require HR Admin approval via workflow. |
| Date of Birth | Employee (own) · HR Admin · Office Admin (view only) | All other roles. Office Admin grant is platform-level and fixed. |
| Performance ratings — draft | Reviewer only | All other roles including HR Admin. No entitlement grant can expose draft ratings prior to publish event. |
| Performance ratings — published | Employee (own) · Manager (own team) · HR Admin · Skip-level (full subtree, retained post-calibration) · HOD/UAG Head (own dept/group — off by default) | Peers · Finance Admin · HRBP. HOD and UAG Head published rating visibility configurable per user by Org Admin. |
| Performance ratings — calibration | Skip-level Manager (full subtree) · HR Admin · HOD (module-level entitlement grant required) | All other roles. |
| Payslips (Phase 2 generated) | Employee (own) · HR Admin · Finance Admin | All manager tiers · HOD · UAG Head · HRBP · Office Admin. |
| Medical / health data | Employee (own) · HR Admin | All other roles. Not transmitted externally without explicit consent. |
| Biometric data (device punch ID, facial recognition data) | No UI display for any role | All roles. Managed at device integration layer only. |
| Compensation bands | HR Admin · Finance Admin (view for budgeting) · Recruitment Admin (offer benchmarking) · Recruiters (band range for assigned requisition only) | Employees · Candidates · Office Admin · All manager tiers. |

