| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| entity_name | string(200) | Y | Full legal name of the entity as it appears in statutory filings. | — |
| entity_short_code | string(6) | Y | 3–6 uppercase chars. Used in employee ID generation. | — |
| entity_pan | string(10) | N | Employer PAN for this entity (10-char alphanumeric). | NULL |
| entity_tan | string(10) | N | Tax Deduction Account Number for TDS filings. | NULL |
| pf_registration_number | string(50) | N | EPFO establishment code for ECR challan (Phase 2). | NULL |
| esi_code | string(50) | N | ESIC employer code for ESI challan (Phase 2). | NULL |
| pt_state | string(50) | N | Professional Tax state — drives slab applicability. | NULL |
| lwf_state | string(50) | N | Labour Welfare Fund state. | NULL |
| registered_address | text | N | Entity-level registered office address. | NULL |
| status | enum | Y | ACTIVE · INACTIVE. | ACTIVE |

*Relationships: Many-to-one with tenants (one tenant has many entities).*

