| region_id | uuid | N | FK → regions.id. | NULL |
| city_type | enum | N | METRO · TIER_2 · TIER_3 · RURAL. Drives HRA / statutory overrides. | NULL |
| centre_type | enum | N | HEAD_OFFICE · BRANCH · DEVELOPMENT_CENTRE · CLIENT_SITE · WAREHOUSE · REGISTERED_OFFICE. | NULL |
| parent_location_id | uuid | N | FK → locations.id. For sub-locations within a campus. | NULL |
