### 4.2.12 weekly_off_patterns

Weekly-off pattern master. Captures the named patterns of non-working days (e.g. “Sat-Sun off”, “Alternate Saturdays”, “Sun off, rotating Sat”). Separate from shifts so the same pattern can be reused across many shifts.

