| field_name | string(120) | Y | Display label shown in UI. | — |
| field_id_code | string(80) | Y | Unique internal identifier within tenant + target module. Format: snake_case, alphanumeric. | — |
| field_type | enum | Y | TEXT · NUMBER · DATE · DATETIME · DROPDOWN · MULTI_SELECT · CHECKBOX · FILE_UPLOAD · EMPLOYEE_PICKER · CURRENCY. | — |
| target_module | enum | Y | EMPLOYEE_PROFILE · ONBOARDING · RECRUITMENT · LEAVE · ATTENDANCE · PERFORMANCE · SEPARATION · DOCUMENT · ASSET. | — |
| target_section | string(120) | N | Within the module, which sub-section (e.g. “Employment Details”, “Bank Details”). | NULL |
| display_in | array(enum) | Y | Where it appears: PROFILE_VIEW · PROFILE_EDIT · REPORTS · EXPORT · FORMS. | [PROFILE_VIEW, PROFILE_EDIT] |
| is_required | boolean | Y | Mandatory at save time. | FALSE |
| is_editable | boolean | Y | If FALSE, field is display-only after first capture. | TRUE |
| allow_decimals | boolean | N | NUMBER fields only. | FALSE |
| number_separator | enum | N | NUMBER fields only: NONE · COMMA · INDIAN_LAKH. | COMMA |
| dropdown_options | jsonb | N | DROPDOWN / MULTI_SELECT only. List of {value, label, sort_order}. | NULL |
| validation_regex | string(500) | N | TEXT fields only. PCRE-compatible. | NULL |
| min_value | numeric | N | NUMBER / DATE only. | NULL |
| max_value | numeric | N | NUMBER / DATE only. | NULL |
| help_text | string(500) | N | Tooltip / inline guidance shown to user. | NULL |
| visibility_role_list | array(enum) | N | Roles that can view this field. NULL means visible to all roles per module’s default. | NULL |
| pii_tier | enum | N | Tier 1 / 2 / 3 / NONE. If non-NULL, applies masking and audit rules. | NULL |
| status | enum | Y | ACTIVE · INACTIVE. | ACTIVE |

*Relationships: Values stored in a generic custom_field_values entity (entity_id, custom_field_id, value_text, value_number, value_date, value_jsonb).*

**Sample data:**

| **field_id_code** | **field_name** | **field_type** | **target_module** | **is_required** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| client_office_location | Client Office Location | DROPDOWN | EMPLOYEE_PROFILE | N |
| performance_appraisal_month | Performance Appraisal Month | DROPDOWN | EMPLOYEE_PROFILE | N |
| former_project | Former Project | TEXT | EMPLOYEE_PROFILE | N |
| contract_end_date_custom | Contract End Date (Custom) | DATE | EMPLOYEE_PROFILE | N |

### 4.2.15 custom_field_values

Generic storage for custom field values. One row per (entity instance × custom_field).

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| custom_field_value_id | uuid | Y | Primary key. | auto |
| custom_field_id | uuid | Y | FK → custom_fields.id. | — |
| target_entity_type | enum | Y | EMPLOYEE · CANDIDATE · REQUISITION · LEAVE_APPLICATION · ATTENDANCE_REQUEST · GOAL · etc. | — |
| target_entity_id | uuid | Y | FK to the row in target entity. | — |
| value_text | text | N | Used for TEXT, DROPDOWN (stored value), MULTI_SELECT (comma-joined). | NULL |
| value_number | numeric | N | Used for NUMBER, CURRENCY. | NULL |
| value_date | date | N | Used for DATE. | NULL |
| value_datetime | timestamp (UTC) | N | Used for DATETIME. | NULL |
| value_boolean | boolean | N | Used for CHECKBOX. | NULL |
| value_jsonb | jsonb | N | Used for MULTI_SELECT (array), FILE_UPLOAD ({file_path, file_name, size}), EMPLOYEE_PICKER (array of employee_id). | NULL |

*Relationships: Composite unique index on (custom_field_id, target_entity_id). Soft-delete via standard audit columns.*

### 4.2.16 national_id_configurations

Meta-configuration for which government / statutory IDs are enabled per country / tenant assignment, with per-field display rules. Replaces hardcoded country-specific ID columns in statutory_identities.

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| national_id_config_id | uuid | Y | Primary key. | auto |
| id_type_code | string(40) | Y | Catalogue code: AADHAAR · PAN · PASSPORT · DRIVING_LICENCE · VOTER_ID · UAN · ESIC_NO · MYKAD · EMIRATES_CARD · SSN · NIN · NRIC · IQAMA · NSSF · BPJS · NPWP · TIN · etc. | — |
| applicable_country_geo_id | uuid | Y | FK → geo_master where geo_type=COUNTRY. Drives which IDs surface for which employee nationality / location. | — |
| applicable_assignment_id | uuid | N | FK → assignment_rules. If non-NULL, this configuration applies only to employees matching the assignment. | NULL |
| is_enabled | boolean | Y | Master toggle. Disabled IDs are hidden from UI. | TRUE |
| alias | string(120) | N | Tenant-specific display name (e.g. “PAN” → “Tax Number” for non-Indian users). | NULL |
| is_temp_id_enabled | boolean | Y | Allow a temporary / provisional ID variant (e.g. EAN before Aadhaar issuance). | FALSE |
| temp_id_alias | string(120) | N | Display name for temporary variant. | NULL |
| issued_from_enabled | boolean | Y | Show “Issued From” / “Issue Date” sub-field. | FALSE |
| issued_from_alias | string(120) | N | Display label for issue date field. | “Issue Date” |
| issued_from_mandatory | boolean | Y | If issued_from_enabled, is it mandatory? | FALSE |
| issued_till_enabled | boolean | Y | Show “Issued Till” / “Valid Till” sub-field. | FALSE |
| issued_till_alias | string(120) | N | Display label for expiry field. | “Valid Till” |
| issued_till_mandatory | boolean | Y | If issued_till_enabled, is it mandatory? | FALSE |
| id_document_enabled | boolean | Y | Show document upload for this ID. | TRUE |
| id_document_alias | string(120) | N | Display label for upload (e.g. “Aadhaar Scan”). | NULL |
| id_document_mandatory | boolean | Y | If id_document_enabled, is the upload mandatory? | FALSE |
| mandatory_for_activation | boolean | Y | Block employee activation (M02) if missing. | FALSE |
| mandatory_for_addition | boolean | Y | Block employee creation if missing. | FALSE |
| is_unique_within_tenant | boolean | Y | Enforce uniqueness across tenant. | FALSE |
| masking_rule | enum | N | NONE · FULL · LAST_4_VISIBLE · FIRST_4_VISIBLE · CUSTOM. Applied at PII Tier per FR-M01-003. | LAST_4_VISIBLE |
| sort_order | integer | Y | Display order in UI. | 1 |
| status | enum | Y | ACTIVE · INACTIVE. | ACTIVE |

*Relationships: Drives which fields in statutory_identities are surfaced; per-ID configuration cached on tenant load.*

