| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| AADHAAR | Aadhaar | India | Y | Y | LAST_4_VISIBLE |
| PAN | PAN | India | Y | Y | LAST_4_VISIBLE |
| UAN | UAN | India | N | Y | NONE |
| ESIC_NO | ESIC Number | India | N | Y | NONE |
| PASSPORT | Passport | India | N | Y | LAST_4_VISIBLE |
| DRIVING_LICENCE | Driving Licence | India | N | N | LAST_4_VISIBLE |

### 4.2.17 assignment_rules

First-class master entity for User Assignment Groups (UAGs) with expression-based targeting. Replaces the simple uag_members enumeration with a rules engine supporting 60+ dimensions, exclusion clauses, and numeric range criteria.

UAGs created via this entity are reusable across leave policies, attendance policies, shifts, performance plans, onboarding processes, separation policies, and any other module requiring employee targeting.

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| assignment_id | uuid | Y | Primary key. | auto |
| assignment_name | string(200) | Y | Display name. | — |
| assignment_code | string(80) | Y | Unique within tenant. | — |
| description | string(1000) | N | Free-text. | NULL |
| applicable_processes | array(enum) | Y | LEAVE_POLICY · ATTENDANCE_POLICY · SHIFT · ONBOARDING_PROCESS · SEPARATION_POLICY · PERFORMANCE_REVIEW · GOAL_PLAN · RECRUITMENT_REQUISITION · DOCUMENT_GENERATION · WORKFLOW · REPORT_FILTER · NOTIFICATION_SCOPE · MULTI_PURPOSE. | [MULTI_PURPOSE] |
| inclusion_criteria | jsonb | Y | Structured rule set (see schema below). Empty array means “all employees”. | [] |
| exclusion_criteria | jsonb | N | Same schema as inclusion_criteria. Subtracts from the inclusion set. | [] |
| numeric_range_criteria | jsonb | N | Experience-based range filters (see schema below). | [] |
| explicit_include_employee_ids | array(uuid) | N | Always-include list, regardless of rules. | [] |
| explicit_exclude_employee_ids | array(uuid) | N | Always-exclude list, regardless of rules. | [] |
| evaluation_mode | enum | Y | STATIC (membership computed once and stored in uag_members) · DYNAMIC (evaluated on every reference). | DYNAMIC |
| status | enum | Y | ACTIVE · INACTIVE. | ACTIVE |

**inclusion_criteria / exclusion_criteria schema** (jsonb):

{ "logic": "AND" | "OR", "dimensions": [ { "field": "department_id" | "designation_id" | "grade_id" | "band_id" | "location_id" | "region_id" | "employment_type" | "employee_sub_type" | "entity_id" | "contribution_level_id" | "appraisal_period" | "notice_period_master_id" | "functional_area" | "project_allocated" | "gender" | "nationality" | "marital_status" | "timezone" | "lifecycle_state" | "current_country" | "permanent_country" | "designation_role_category" | "salutation" | "blood_group" | "current_state" | "current_city" | "permanent_state" | "permanent_city" | "company_country" | "pay_group" | "pf_applicability" | "eps_applicability" | "esic_applicability" | "lwf_applicability" | "pt_applicability" | "tds_applicability" | "probation_flag" | "notice_flag" | "manager_level" | "is_hod" | "is_hrbp" | "is_standard_role_1" | "is_standard_role_2" | "is_standard_role_3" | "designation_exempt_status" | "rotational_shift" | "sub_community_details" | "emergency_contact_relation" | "client_office_location" | "performance_appraisal_month" | "contract_status" | "work_type" | "capability" | "<custom_field_id_code>", "operator": "EQUALS" | "NOT_EQUALS" | "IN" | "NOT_IN" | "IS_NULL" | "IS_NOT_NULL", "values": ["..."] } ] }

**numeric_range_criteria schema** (jsonb):

[ { "field": "experience_from_doj" | "experience_from_group_doj" | "age" | "experience_in_current_role" | "experience_in_company", "condition": "BETWEEN" | "LESS_THAN" | "GREATER_THAN" | "EQUALS", "unit": "DAYS" | "MONTHS" | "YEARS", "value_from": , "value_to": <number | null> } ]

*Relationships: Referenced by every policy entity needing employee scoping (leave_policies, attendance_policies, separation_policies, goal_plan_templates, review_templates, onboarding_processes, etc.) via applicable_to_uag_id. uag_members materialises STATIC assignments; DYNAMIC ones evaluate at runtime.*

**Sample assignment:**

| **assignment_code** | **assignment_name** | **applicable_processes** | **inclusion_criteria** | **exclusion_criteria** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| ASG_PERM_FT_IN | Permanent Full-Time India | [LEAVE_POLICY, ATTENDANCE_POLICY, PERFORMANCE_REVIEW] | logic:AND, dimensions:[{employment_type=FULL_TIME}, {nationality=Indian}] | logic:AND, dimensions:[{lifecycle_state IN [NOTICE, SEPARATED]}] |
| ASG_NEW_HIRES_2026 | New Hires 2026 Onwards | [ONBOARDING_PROCESS, GOAL_PLAN] | logic:AND, dimensions:[] | (empty) — but numeric_range_criteria=[{field:experience_from_doj, condition:LESS_THAN, unit:MONTHS, value_from:12}] |

