### 4.2.21 projects

Project master — the catalogue of projects (services-business engagements) that employees can be allocated to. The project_allocated linkage on employment_history, assignment_one/two/three_groups, departments, designations, and grades resolves to a row here. **Managed by HR Admin, scoped to the HR Admin’s entity** (each project belongs to a single legal entity via entity_id). Org Admin retains read visibility for cross-entity reporting but no longer owns project creation.

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| project_id | uuid | Y | Primary key. | auto |
| project_code | string(40) | Y | Unique within tenant. Immutable post-creation. | — |
| project_name | string(160) | Y | Display name. | — |
| client_name | string(160) | N | Client / customer the project is delivered for. NULL for internal projects. | NULL |
| entity_id | uuid | Y | FK → entities.id. Owning legal entity. A project belongs to exactly one entity (projects do not span entities). | — |
| location_id | uuid | N | FK → locations.id. Primary delivery location. | NULL |
| project_head_user_id | uuid | N | FK → users.id. Project head / delivery lead. | NULL |
| start_date | date | N | Project start. | NULL |
| end_date | date | N | Planned end; NULL = ongoing. | NULL |
| is_billable | boolean | Y | Whether allocation to this project is billable. | TRUE |
| status | enum | Y | ACTIVE · ON_HOLD · CLOSED. | ACTIVE |

**Mapping rule:** project_allocated text fields elsewhere resolve to projects.project_code; on migration, distinct project values from the Assignment masters are seeded as project rows.

**Sample data:**

| **project_code** | **project_name** | **client_name** | **project_head** | **status** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| PRJ-ALPHA | Payments Platform | Acme Bank | Manager One | ACTIVE |
| PRJ-BETA | Identity Revamp | Internal | Sneha Iyer | ACTIVE |
| PRJ-GAMMA | Data Migration | Globex Corp | Arjun Rao | ON_HOLD |

### 4.3.1 users

Authentication identity. One row per individual person who can log into the platform — employees, candidates, pre-joiners, contractors, and platform administrators. Distinct from the ‘employees’ entity, which holds HR-domain data.

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| username | string(120) | Y | Unique within tenant. For Google SSO users, the Google email. | — |
| email | string(200) | Y | Unique within tenant. Format: RFC 5322. Used for notifications and password reset. | — |
| password_hash | string(255) | N | One-way hash with appropriate cost factor. NULL for SSO-only users. Never stored in plain text or reversible form. | NULL |
| auth_provider | enum | Y | USERNAME_PASSWORD · GOOGLE_SSO. | USERNAME_PASSWORD |
| mfa_enabled | boolean | Y | MFA is enforced by default for HR Admin and Organisation Admin roles. Configurable per user. | FALSE |
| mfa_method | enum | N | TOTP · SMS_OTP. | NULL |
| last_login_at | timestamp (UTC) | N | Set at successful login. | NULL |
| failed_login_count | integer | Y | Reset on successful login. Triggers lockout at configured threshold. | 0 |
| locked_until | timestamp (UTC) | N | Account lockout expiry. NULL means not locked. | NULL |
| status | enum | Y | ACTIVE · LOCKED · DISABLED. | ACTIVE |
| consent_captured_at | timestamp (UTC) | N | DPDPA consent capture timestamp. NULL means consent not yet captured. | NULL |

**Sample data:**

| **username** | **auth_provider** | **mfa_enabled** | **status** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| [alice.k@primesoft.in](mailto:alice.k@primesoft.in) | GOOGLE_SSO | TRUE | ACTIVE |
| candidate.13799@external | USERNAME_PASSWORD | FALSE | ACTIVE |
| [raj.m@primesoft.in](mailto:raj.m@primesoft.in) | GOOGLE_SSO | TRUE | ACTIVE |

