### 4.3.3 user_role_assignments

Many-to-many between users and roles, scoped to entity. A user may hold multiple roles simultaneously — Conflict Resolution Rule applies (more restrictive permission wins).

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| user_id | uuid | Y | FK → users.id. | — |
| role_id | uuid | Y | FK → roles.id. | — |
| entity_id | uuid | N | FK → entities.id. NULL for tenant-scoped or platform-scoped roles. | NULL |
| assigned_at | timestamp (UTC) | Y | Assignment timestamp. | now() |
| expires_at | timestamp (UTC) | N | Time-bound assignment expiry. NULL means permanent. | NULL |
| assigned_by | uuid | Y | FK → users.id of the actor who created the assignment. Org Admin or Platform Super Admin. | — |

