| resource_identifier | string(200) | Y | Scope of the grant — department code, field name, section name, module code, or contribution level. | — |
| justification | text | Y | Free-text reason. Audit-visible. | — |
| granted_at | timestamp (UTC) | Y |  | now() |
| expires_at | date | Y | Mandatory expiry — no open-ended individual entitlements permitted. | — |
| granted_by | uuid | Y | FK → users.id. Must be Organisation Admin. | — |
| revoked_at | timestamp (UTC) | N | Set when entitlement is revoked before expiry. | NULL |
| revoked_by | uuid | N | Set when entitlement is revoked before expiry. | NULL |

