## 4.4 Employee Master Entities (M01)

### 4.4.1 employees

Central reference entity for the entire platform. One row per employee per tenant. Employee ID is immutable once assigned. Single record per employee across the tenant — cross-entity transfers create a new version of the employment record, not a new employee row. Rehire after separation creates a new row with a link to the prior employee_id.

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| employee_id | string(20) | Y | Format: {entity_short_code}{6-digit zero-padded sequence}. Unique within tenant, not just entity. Immutable post-assignment. | — |
| user_id | uuid | Y | FK → users.id. One-to-one relationship with login identity. | — |
| salutation | enum | N | MR · MRS · MS · DR · PROF · OTHER. | NULL |
| first_name | string(80) | Y | Per profile policy. | — |
| middle_name | string(80) | N | Optional middle name. | NULL |
| last_name | string(80) | Y | Per profile policy. | — |
| display_name | string(200) | Y | Auto-derived from first + middle + last; HR Admin override allowed. | auto |
| official_email | string(200) | Y | Corporate email. Unique within tenant. Immutable post-assignment per policy. | — |
| official_mobile | string(20) | N | Office contact mobile (directory tier). | NULL |
| official_mobile_visibility | enum | N | EVERYONE · MANAGER_AND_HR · HR_ONLY. | EVERYONE |
| office_extension | string(20) | N | Internal extension number. | NULL |
| personal_email | string(200) | Y | Non-corporate domain. Used for separation-period self-service. | — |
| personal_mobile_primary | string(20) | Y | Format: 10-digit national or +country-code prefix. Used for OTP and DPDPA consent. | — |
| personal_mobile_secondary | string(20) | N | Optional second contact number. | NULL |
| personal_mobile_visibility | enum | N | EVERYONE · MANAGER_AND_HR · HR_ONLY. | MANAGER_AND_HR |
| date_of_joining | date | Y | Immutable once set. Cross-entity transfer creates new employment version, not new DOJ. | — |
| group_date_of_joining | date | Y | Set on first employment in the group; never changes thereafter. | — |
| retirement_date | date | N | Derived from DOB + tenant retirement-age policy. Editable for executive overrides. | derived |
| profile_photo_url | string(500) | N | Image URL or NULL for initials avatar. | NULL |
| gender | enum | Y | MALE · FEMALE · OTHER · PREFER_NOT_TO_SAY. | — |
| date_of_birth | date | Y | PII Tier 2. Year display configurable per platform policy. | — |
| date_of_birth_year_visibility | enum | N | EVERYONE · MONTH_DAY_ONLY · HR_ONLY. Controls how DOB displays on profiles and calendar. Superseded by §3.10 (FY26): DOB is visible only to the employee, HR Admin and Office Admin — no manager / HOD / HRBP / peer / social-surface visibility and no year-masking; this enum no longer drives display. Birthday celebration is governed instead by a separate, employee-managed boolean share_birthday_with_team (default FALSE, employee-editable) that exposes month + day only — never the DOB field. See §10.2.4 and FR-M01-020 amendment. | MONTH_DAY_ONLY |
| country_of_birth_geo_id | uuid | N | FK → geo_master where geo_type=COUNTRY. | NULL |
| nationality | string(80) | Y | Drives statutory scope. | Indian |
| marital_status | enum | N | SINGLE · MARRIED · DIVORCED · WIDOWED · SEPARATED. | NULL |
| marital_anniversary_date | date | N | Required if marital_status = MARRIED. | NULL |
| marital_anniversary_visibility | enum | N | EVERYONE · MANAGER_AND_HR · HR_ONLY · HIDDEN. | MANAGER_AND_HR |
| blood_group | string(10) | N | PII Tier 3 (health). Visible to employee and HR Admin only. | NULL |
| father_name | string(200) | N | Used for statutory forms (PF, ESIC) and tax declarations. | NULL |
| mother_name | string(200) | N | Used for statutory forms. | NULL |
| sub_community_details | string(200) | N | India: sub-caste / community for diversity reporting. PII Tier 2. | NULL |
| rotational_shift_flag | boolean | N | Whether employee participates in rotational shift roster. | FALSE |
| lifecycle_state | enum | Y | PRE_JOINING · ACTIVE · NOTICE · LAST_WORKING_DAY · SEPARATED · ABSCONDED · REHIRE_ELIGIBLE. Probation is a sub-state of ACTIVE tracked via probation flag on employment record. | PRE_JOINING |
| previous_employee_id | string(20) | N | Link to prior record on rehire. NULL on first hire. | NULL |
| continuous_service_flag | boolean | N | Indicates rehire with continuous service credit. | FALSE |
| read_only_until | date | N | Read-only access period post-separation. Set to LWD + 180 days by default. | NULL |
| absconding_flagged_at | timestamp (UTC) | N | Set when M05 absconding threshold (7 consecutive calendar days) is met. | NULL |
| profile_completeness_pct | integer | Y | 0-100. Computed from configured field set. Blocks leave application below mandatory minimum. | 0 |
| timezone | string(60) | N | IANA timezone identifier. Defaults to current location timezone. | derived |
| linkedin_url | string(500) | N | Optional social profile. | NULL |
| portfolio_url | string(500) | N | Optional portfolio / GitHub / personal site. | NULL |
| attendance_modality | enum | Y | Attendance capture modality per FR-M05-020. CLOCK_IN_ONLY · CHECK_IN_ONLY · BOTH. Drives which buttons the employee sees on the attendance page. | CLOCK_IN_ONLY |

**Sample data:**

| **employee_id** | **display_name** | **official_email** | **lifecycle_state** | **date_of_joining** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| PSI000123 | Alice Kumar | [alice.k@primesoft.in](mailto:alice.k@primesoft.in) | ACTIVE | 2024-06-15 |
| PSI000457 | Raj Menon | [raj.m@primesoft.in](mailto:raj.m@primesoft.in) | NOTICE | 2022-03-01 |
| PSI000789 | Manager One | [priya.n@primesoft.in](mailto:priya.n@primesoft.in) | ACTIVE | 2025-11-04 |

### 4.4.2 employment_history

*Section relocated to §4.4.13 in v1.2 to position it adjacent to the new statutory clusters (§4.4.6–§4.4.12) and the new employee sub-entities (§4.4.18–§4.4.27). See §4.4.13 for the full expanded definition.*

