### 4.4.5 statutory_identities

Per-employee statutory ID values. Schema is dynamic — fields surfaced per national_id_configurations (§4.2.16) for the employee’s nationality and assignment.

Core India IDs are listed below; non-India IDs use the same row schema with id_type discriminator.

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| statutory_identity_id | uuid | Y | Primary key. | auto |
| employee_id | uuid | Y | FK → employees.id. | — |
| id_type | string(40) | Y | FK → national_id_configurations.id_type_code. | — |
| id_value | string(200) | Y | The actual ID number (PII Tier 1). Encrypted at rest. | — |
| name_on_id | string(200) | N | Name as printed on the ID document (may differ from official name). | NULL |
| issue_date | date | N | When ID was issued (if config requires). | NULL |
| validity_until | date | N | Expiry date (if config requires). | NULL |
| issued_from_place | string(200) | N | Issuing location. | NULL |
| issuing_authority | string(200) | N | Issuing body. | NULL |
| is_temporary | boolean | Y | TRUE if this is a temporary / provisional variant (e.g. EAN before Aadhaar). | FALSE |
| document_file_path | string(500) | N | Scan upload. | NULL |
| verification_status | enum | Y | NOT_VERIFIED · IN_PROGRESS · VERIFIED · DISPUTED · FAILED. | NOT_VERIFIED |
| verified_by_user_id | uuid | N | FK → users.id. | NULL |
| verified_at | timestamp (UTC) | N | Verification completion time. | NULL |

*Relationships: Many rows per employee, one per ID type per nationality scope. Composite unique constraint on (employee_id, id_type). Configuration surfaced through national_id_configurations. Masked per masking_rule from config.*

**Sample data (India employee, post-Phase 3 schema):**

| **employee_id** | **id_type** | **id_value (masked)** | **issue_date** | **validity_until** | **verification_status** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| PSI000123 | AADHAAR | XXXX-XXXX-7892 | 2015-04-12 | NULL | VERIFIED |
| PSI000123 | PAN | XXXXX5689F | 2017-08-22 | NULL | VERIFIED |
| PSI000123 | UAN | XXXXXXXX3421 | 2024-06-20 | NULL | VERIFIED |
| PSI000123 | PASSPORT | XXXXXX782 | 2020-01-15 | 2030-01-14 | VERIFIED |
| PSI000457 | AADHAAR | XXXX-XXXX-1234 | 2014-09-03 | NULL | VERIFIED |

### 4.4.6 statutory_pf_details

Provident Fund (PF) detail cluster. Replaces single pf_uan field with full PF lifecycle data.

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| pf_detail_id | uuid | Y | Primary key. | auto |
| employee_id | uuid | Y | FK → employees.id. | — |
| pf_number | string(40) | N | Old-style PF account number (legacy; pre-UAN). | NULL |
| pf_uan | string(20) | N | Universal Account Number (12-digit). Tier 1 PII. | NULL |
| pf_applicable | boolean | Y | Whether PF is applicable to this employee. | TRUE |
| pf_applicable_from_date | date | N | Effective from date for PF deduction. | NULL |
| pf_registration_location_geo_id | uuid | N | FK → geo_master. Registered PF office location. | NULL |
| pf_restriction_amount | numeric(15,2) | N | Salary cap for PF contribution (e.g. ₹15,000/month default per EPF Act). | 15000.00 |
| restrict_company_pf_to_statutory_max | boolean | Y | Whether employer’s PF contribution is capped at statutory max. | TRUE |
| pf_account_type | enum | N | NEW_PF · TRANSFERRED · LEGACY · INTERNATIONAL_WORKER. | NEW_PF |
| previous_employer_pf_transferred | boolean | Y | Whether previous PF balance was transferred. | FALSE |
| pf_nominee_dependent_id | uuid | N | FK → dependents.id (nominee for PF balance). | NULL |

*Relationships: One-to-one with employees. Nominations resolved via dependents.dependent_for = ‘PF’.*

### 4.4.7 statutory_eps_details

Employees’ Pension Scheme (EPS) detail cluster. EPS is a sub-component of PF for monthly pension contribution.

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| eps_detail_id | uuid | Y | Primary key. | auto |
| employee_id | uuid | Y | FK → employees.id. | — |
| eps_applicable | boolean | Y | Whether EPS is applicable. Typically TRUE if salary ≤ statutory threshold at joining. | TRUE |
| name_as_per_aadhaar | string(200) | N | Required to align EPS records with Aadhaar database. | NULL |
| eps_pension_number | string(40) | N | Pension reference number. | NULL |
| eps_contribution_capped | boolean | Y | Whether contribution is capped at statutory ceiling. | TRUE |

*Relationships: One-to-one with employees.*

