Employees’ State Insurance Corporation (ESIC) detail cluster. Applicable for employees earning below statutory threshold.

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| esic_detail_id | uuid | Y | Primary key. | auto |
