| esic_registration_code | string(40) | N | Registration office code. | NULL |
| esic_dispensary_code | string(40) | N | Allotted dispensary for medical claims. | NULL |

*Relationships: One-to-one with employees.*

### 4.4.9 statutory_gratuity_details

Gratuity is a statutory lump-sum payment to employees who complete 5+ years of continuous service (per Payment of Gratuity Act 1972 in India).

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| gratuity_detail_id | uuid | Y | Primary key. | auto |
| employee_id | uuid | Y | FK → employees.id. | — |
| gratuity_number | string(40) | N | Internal gratuity tracking number. | NULL |
| gratuity_eligible_date | date | Y | Computed: date_of_joining + 5 years. | computed |
| is_eligible_now | boolean | Y | Computed: TRUE if gratuity_eligible_date ≤ today. | computed |
| gratuity_nominee_dependent_id | uuid | N | FK → dependents.id. | NULL |
| nomination_date | date | N | When nomination was filed. | NULL |
| nomination_form_file_path | string(500) | N | Signed Form F (India statutory) scan. | NULL |

*Relationships: One-to-one with employees.*

