### 4.4.13 employment_history

Effective-date versioned employment record. Every change to a versioned field creates a new history row. Past-dated and future-dated changes supported.

This is the v1.2 expansion of v1.1 §4.4.2. Existing fields retained; new fields appended below.

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| employee_id | uuid | Y | FK → employees.id. | — |
| effective_from | date | Y | Start of this version. | — |
| effective_to | date | N | End of this version. NULL means current. | NULL |
| entity_id | uuid | Y | FK → entities.id. | — |
| department_id | uuid | Y | FK → departments.id. | — |
| designation_id | uuid | Y | FK → designations.id. | — |
| grade_id | uuid | Y | FK → grades.id. | — |
| band_id | uuid | N | FK → bands.id. (Was string in v1.1.) | NULL |
| contribution_level_id | uuid | Y | FK → contribution_levels.id. (Was enum in v1.1.) | — |
| business_unit_id | uuid | N | FK → business_units.id (new master). | NULL |
| functional_area | string(120) | N | Specialism / practice area. | NULL |
| job_family | string(120) | N | Job family classification. | NULL |
| division | string(120) | N | Organisational division above department. | NULL |
| pay_scale_id | uuid | N | FK → pay_scales (Phase 2 payroll). | NULL |
| location_id | uuid | Y | FK → locations.id. | — |
| client_office_location | string(300) | N | Services-business: client-side work location. | NULL |
| project_allocated | string(120) | N | Services-business: current project. | NULL |
| former_project | string(120) | N | Most recent prior project. | NULL |
| work_type | enum | N | ONSITE · REMOTE · HYBRID · CLIENT_PREMISES. | ONSITE |
| reporting_manager_id | uuid | N | FK → employees.id. Cycle prevention enforced at save. | NULL |
| dotted_line_manager_id | uuid | N | FK → employees.id. | NULL |
| employment_type | enum | Y | FULL_TIME · PART_TIME · CONTRACT · CONSULTANT · ASSOCIATE · INTERN. | FULL_TIME |
| employee_sub_type | string(120) | N | Sub-classification (e.g. “Trainee”, “Apprentice”, “Returnship”). | NULL |
| employee_group_assignment_id | uuid | N | FK → assignment_one_groups.id. | NULL |
| performance_appraisal_month | enum | N | JAN…DEC. Anniversary appraisal month. | NULL |
| performance_appraisal_period | string(40) | N | Period code (e.g. “FY26-Annual”). | NULL |
| capability_tag | string(120) | N | Skill / competency classification. | NULL |
| probation_flag | boolean | Y | TRUE during probation. | TRUE |
| probation_end_date | date | N | Calendar-driven trigger for confirmation workflow. | NULL |
| probation_extension_months | enum | N | Extension period chosen by the manager when the probation decision is EXTEND: 1, 2, or 3 months. Re-triggers the confirmation workflow at the new probation_end_date − 15 days; generates LTR_PROBATION_EXTEND. NULL unless an extension is in effect. | NULL |
| confirmation_date | date | N | Set when probation completes successfully. | NULL |
| contract_start_date | date | N | For Contract/Consultant. | NULL |
| contract_end_date | date | N | For Contract/Consultant. Triggers calendar reminders at 60/30 days. | NULL |
| contract_status | enum | N | PRE_CONTRACT · ACTIVE · EXPIRING_SOON · EXPIRED · RENEWED · TERMINATED. | NULL |
| notice_period_master_id | uuid | N | FK → notice_period_masters.id (new master in §4.8.5). | NULL |
| notice_period_days | integer | Y | Resolved value. Calculated using working days per Org default (5/6). | 60 |
| cost_centre_code | string(30) | N | Per department mapping; override permitted. | NULL |
| pay_group | string(120) | N | Phase 2 payroll grouping. | NULL |
| change_reason | string(200) | N | Reason captured for audit (promotion, transfer, etc.). | NULL |
| correction_flag | boolean | Y | TRUE for past-dated corrections, distinct from natural versioning. | FALSE |
| is_hod | boolean | Y | Computed: TRUE if employee is HOD of any department. | FALSE |
| is_hrbp | boolean | Y | Computed: TRUE if employee is HRBP for any department / UAG. | FALSE |
| is_standard_role_1 | boolean | N | Tenant-defined custom role flag 1. | FALSE |
| is_standard_role_2 | boolean | N | Tenant-defined custom role flag 2. | FALSE |
| is_standard_role_3 | boolean | N | Tenant-defined custom role flag 3. | FALSE |
| designation_exempt_status | enum | N | US wage law: EXEMPT · NON_EXEMPT. NULL for non-US employees. | NULL |
| manager_level | integer | Y | Computed: depth in reporting tree (0 = top of org). | computed |
| total_experience_at_joining_months | integer | N | Prior experience credited at DOJ. | 0 |

*Relationships: Many-to-one with employees. Same employee has many history rows; one active row (effective_to IS NULL) at any time.*

### 4.4.14 bank_details

Bank account for salary disbursement (Phase 2 active). Office Admin can enter and update — direct write, no approval. Cannot view full account numbers — masked to last 4 digits after entry. Employee-initiated change requires HR Admin approval.

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| employee_id | uuid | Y | FK → employees.id. One active row per employee. | — |
| account_holder_name | string(120) | Y | Must match employee legal name. | — |
| bank_name | string(120) | Y |  | — |
| account_number | encrypted string | Y | Encrypted at rest. Display restricted to last 4 digits (****1234). | — |
| ifsc_code | encrypted string | Y | 11 alphanumeric chars. Encrypted; decrypted at runtime only for payroll disbursement (Phase 2). | — |
| account_type | enum | Y | SAVINGS · CURRENT. | SAVINGS |
| is_active | boolean | Y | Only one active bank account per employee at a time. | TRUE |

