### 4.4.15 dependents

Dependent and nominee records. Max 10 dependents per employee (tenant-configurable). Sum of nominee_percentage = 100 per nominee class (validated at save).

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| dependent_id | uuid | Y | Primary key. | auto |
| employee_id | uuid | Y | FK → employees.id. | — |
| name | string(120) | Y | 1–120 chars. | — |
| relation | enum | Y | SPOUSE · CHILD · PARENT · PARENT_IN_LAW · SIBLING · OTHER. | — |
| date_of_birth | date | Y | ≤ today. | — |
| gender | enum | Y | MALE · FEMALE · OTHER. | — |
| dependent_for | json array | Y | INSURANCE · GRATUITY · PF · EPS · ESI · OTHER (multi). | [] |
| nominee_percentage | json object | N | {class: percentage}; sum per class = 100 across dependents. | {} |
| is_emergency_contact | boolean | N | Convenience flag. | FALSE |
| marital_status | enum | N | Same enum as employees.marital_status. | NULL |
| occupation | string(200) | N | Free text. | NULL |
| employer_name | string(300) | N | If dependent is employed. | NULL |
| monthly_income | numeric(15,2) | N | Dependent income (Tier-1 PII). | NULL |
| income_currency | string(3) | N | ISO 4217. | NULL |
| dependent_pan | string(20) | N | India: PAN if income > threshold. | NULL |
| dependent_aadhaar | string(20) | N | India: Aadhaar (Tier-1 PII). | NULL |
| residential_address | string(500) | N | If different from employee’s. | NULL |
| is_minor | boolean | Y | Computed from date_of_birth. | FALSE |
| guardian_name | string(200) | N | Required if is_minor = TRUE. | NULL |
| guardian_relation | string(120) | N | Relation of guardian. | NULL |

