### 4.4.16 employee_documents

Per-employee document vault. Owned by M01; storage substrate is M11. Personal documents (Aadhaar scan, PAN card, passport scan, etc.), system-generated letters (offer, joining, confirmation, hike, separation), education and certification documents.

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| employee_id | uuid | Y | FK → employees.id. | — |
| document_type | enum | Y | PAN_SCAN · AADHAAR_SCAN · PASSPORT_SCAN · DRIVING_LICENCE_SCAN · RESUME · EDUCATION_CERTIFICATE · OFFER_LETTER · JOINING_LETTER · CONFIRMATION_LETTER · HIKE_LETTER · SEPARATION_LETTER · CONTRACT · BGV_SELF_DECLARATION · VACCINATION_RECORD · MEDICAL_RECORD · STATUTORY_DECLARATION · OTHER. | — |
| file_name | string(200) | Y | Original filename. | — |
| file_path | string(500) | Y | Object storage path. Pre-signed URLs (5-min expiry) for download. | — |
| file_size_bytes | integer | Y | Max 25 MB per file. | — |
| mime_type | string(100) | Y | Whitelist: application/pdf · application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document · application/msword · image/jpeg · image/png. | — |
| pii_tier | integer | Y | 1 (Restricted) · 2 (Sensitive) · 3 (Personal) · 4 (Directory). | — |
| uploaded_by_role | string(50) | Y | Role code of uploader. | — |
| version | integer | Y | Version number. Replacement creates new version; up to 10 versions retained on hot storage. | 1 |
| virus_scan_status | enum | Y | PENDING · CLEAN · INFECTED. INFECTED files are quarantined and not committed to durable storage. | PENDING |
| retention_until | date | N | Disposal date. Statutory documents have legally mandated minimums; non-statutory has configured retention. | NULL |
| is_acknowledged | boolean | N | TRUE if employee has acknowledged (for sign-off documents). | FALSE |
| acknowledged_at | timestamp (UTC) | N | Acknowledgement timestamp. | NULL |

**Sample data:**

| **employee (display)** | **document_type** | **file_name** | **version** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| PSI000123 | PAN_SCAN | PAN_AliceK.pdf | 1 |
| PSI000123 | OFFER_LETTER | OfferLetter_PSI000123.pdf | 1 |
| PSI000457 | CONFIRMATION_LETTER | Confirmation_PSI000457.pdf | 1 |

### 4.4.17 grievances

Standalone sub-module of M01. Workplace, manager, compensation, POSH categories. Anonymous opt-in. POSH routes to ICC committee (not HR Admin).

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| employee_id | uuid | N | FK → employees.id. NULL if anonymous_flag = TRUE for non-POSH categories. | NULL |
| category | enum | Y | WORKPLACE · POSH · COMPENSATION · MANAGER · OTHER. POSH routes to ICC. Workplace/Manager/Other/Compensation route to HR Admin queue. | — |
| subject | string(200) | Y | Brief subject. | — |
| description | text | Y | Free-text description. | — |
| anonymous_flag | boolean | Y | When TRUE: HR Admin sees category and count only, not identity or content. For POSH, identity revealed to ICC only. | FALSE |
| attachments | json array | N | Array of employee_documents.id references. | [] |
| status | enum | Y | OPEN · UNDER_INVESTIGATION · RESOLVED · CLOSED. | OPEN |
| assigned_to_user_id | uuid | N | FK → users.id of HR Admin or ICC member. | NULL |
| acknowledged_at | timestamp (UTC) | N | Within 2 business days SLA. | NULL |
| resolved_at | timestamp (UTC) | N | Within 30 business days (non-POSH) / 90 business days (POSH, statutory). | NULL |
| resolution_notes | text | N | Audit-visible. | NULL |

**Sample data:**

| **category** | **subject** | **anonymous_flag** | **status** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| WORKPLACE | Workspace ergonomics | FALSE | RESOLVED |
| POSH | Inappropriate behaviour — manager | TRUE | UNDER_INVESTIGATION |
| COMPENSATION | Pay parity concern | FALSE | OPEN |

