### 4.4.23 employee_education

**Entity reconciliation note (§4.4 integrity). **§4.4 contains two appended numbering runs. The granular profile entities §4.4.23–4.4.32 (education, work experience, certifications, skills, languages, disabilities, visa, extended dependents, bond, past-company references) were renumbered to remove the collision with the first run (which previously reused 4.4.18–4.4.22). Canonical-entity decisions, applied in BRD §4.4 (CLOSED): merge employee_disability into employee_disabilities; merge employee_visas into employee_visa; merge dependents into employee_dependent_details_extended; and reconcile the duplicate employment_history definition (§4.4.2 and §4.4.13) into one canonical entity. Surviving attributes are fixed in the canonical tables: employee_disabilities (§4.4.28), employee_visa (§4.4.29), dependents (§4.4.15), and employment_history (§4.4.13). The old definitions employee_disability (§4.4.18), employee_visas (§4.4.19) and employee_dependent_details_extended (§4.4.30) have been removed.

Education history. One row per qualification. Versioned by audit columns; corrections create a new row with correction_flag = TRUE.

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| education_id | uuid | Y | Primary key. | auto |
| employee_id | uuid | Y | FK → employees.id. | — |
| qualification_type | enum | Y | TENTH · TWELFTH · DIPLOMA · BACHELORS · MASTERS · DOCTORATE · POST_DOCTORATE · PROFESSIONAL_CERTIFICATION · OTHER. | — |
| degree_name | string(200) | Y | Degree / programme name (e.g. “B.Tech in Computer Science”). | — |
| specialisation | string(200) | N | Major / specialisation. | NULL |
| institution_name | string(300) | Y | School / college / university name. | — |
| university_board_name | string(300) | N | Affiliated university or board. | NULL |
| country_geo_id | uuid | N | FK → geo_master where geo_type=COUNTRY. Where institution is based. | NULL |
| start_date | date | Y | Programme start date. | — |
| end_date | date | N | Programme end / graduation date. NULL if currently enrolled. | NULL |
| is_currently_enrolled | boolean | Y | TRUE if education is ongoing. | FALSE |
| grade_or_percentage | string(40) | N | Final grade (e.g. “8.5 CGPA”, “78%”, “First Class”). | NULL |
| education_mode | enum | N | FULL_TIME · PART_TIME · DISTANCE · ONLINE · CORRESPONDENCE. | NULL |
| certificate_file_path | string(500) | N | Path to scanned certificate (PII Tier 3). | NULL |
| verification_status | enum | Y | NOT_VERIFIED · IN_PROGRESS · VERIFIED · DISPUTED · FAILED. | NOT_VERIFIED |
| verified_by_user_id | uuid | N | FK → users.id. | NULL |
| verified_at | timestamp (UTC) | N | When verification was completed. | NULL |
| verification_source | enum | N | BGV_PROVIDER · DOCUMENT_REVIEW · INSTITUTION_DIRECT · UNIVERSITY_PORTAL · OTHER. | NULL |
| verification_notes | string(1000) | N | Free text. | NULL |
| sort_order | integer | Y | Display order on profile. | 1 |

*Relationships: Many-to-one with employees. Verification linked to BGV results via verification_source = BGV_PROVIDER.*

