### 4.5.3 employee_leave_balances

Per-employee, per-leave-type, per-year balance. Updated by accrual scheduled jobs and on every leave transaction.

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| employee_id | uuid | Y | FK → employees.id. | — |
| leave_type_id | uuid | Y | FK → leave_types.id. | — |
| leave_year | integer | Y | e.g. 2026 (calendar year). Leave cycle resets per financial year per A.1 of M04. | — |
| opening_balance | decimal(7,2) | Y | Including any carry-forward. | 0.00 |
| accrued_to_date | decimal(7,2) | Y | Cumulative accrual. | 0.00 |
| consumed_to_date | decimal(7,2) | Y | Cumulative consumption. | 0.00 |
| encashed_to_date | decimal(7,2) | Y | Cumulative encashment (HR Admin authorised only). | 0.00 |
| adjusted_to_date | decimal(7,2) | Y | Manual adjustments by Leave Admin. | 0.00 |
| available_balance | decimal(7,2) | Y | Computed: opening + accrued − consumed − encashed + adjusted. | 0.00 |
| carry_forward_to_next_year | decimal(7,2) | Y | Captured at year-end. Zero before computation. | 0.00 |

