| leave_type_id | uuid | Y | FK → leave_types.id. | — |
| from_date | date | Y | Leave start. | — |
| to_date | date | Y | Leave end. | — |
| total_days | decimal(5,2) | Y | Computed; supports 0.5 increments for half-day. | — |
