| attachment_document_id | uuid | N | FK → employee_documents.id. Required after configured day threshold for some types. | NULL |
| status | enum | Y | DRAFT · SUBMITTED · STAGE_1_APPROVED · STAGE_2_APPROVED · APPROVED · REJECTED · WITHDRAWN · REVOKED · ESCALATED. | DRAFT |
| applied_on_date | date | Y | Drives SLA timers. “Act on requests based on Applied on date” is the global setting. | today |
| raised_on_behalf_by | uuid | N | FK → users.id. Set when L1 Manager / HRBP / HR Admin / Leave Admin raises on behalf. | NULL |
