| allow_manager_revoke_system_deducted | boolean | Y | Manager can revoke system-deducted leave (e.g. ML auto-deduction). | FALSE |
| allow_employee_revoke_approved | boolean | Y | Employee can request revocation of approved leave. | TRUE |
| allow_employee_revoke_past_dated_approved | boolean | Y | Employee can request revocation for past-dated leave. | FALSE |
| allow_employee_revoke_system_deducted | boolean | Y | Employee can request revocation for system-deducted leave. | FALSE |
| revoke_system_deducted_uses_original_approval_flow | boolean | Y | Route revocation through original approval flow. | TRUE |
| allow_revoke_auto_approve | boolean | Y | Auto-approve revocation requests. | FALSE |

