### 4.5.8 leave_compoff_policies

Comp-Off and Overtime-to-Leave conversion policy definitions. Each tenant can define multiple comp-off policies (one per shift class, location, employee group, etc.).

Given the 286-field source schema, fields are grouped by day class (Weekday / Weekly Off / Holiday) and frequency (Weekly / Bi-Weekly / Monthly / Semi-Monthly).

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| compoff_policy_id | uuid | Y | Primary key. | auto |
| policy_name | string(200) | Y | Display name. | — |
| policy_code | string(80) | Y | Unique within tenant. | — |
| description | string(1000) | N | Free text. | NULL |
| set_overtime_policy_for | enum | Y | EMPLOYEE_GROUP · LOCATION · DESIGNATION · CUSTOM_ASSIGNMENT. | CUSTOM_ASSIGNMENT |
| applicable_to_uag_id | uuid | N | FK → assignment_rules.id. | NULL |
| status | enum | Y | ACTIVE · INACTIVE · DRAFT. | DRAFT |
| calculation_frequency | enum | Y | DAILY · WEEKLY · BI_WEEKLY · MONTHLY · SEMI_MONTHLY. | DAILY |

**Hourly Leave configuration:**

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| is_hourly_leave | boolean | Y | Whether leave is tracked in hours. | FALSE |
| hourly_leave_hours_in_day | numeric(4,2) | N | Hours that equate to one full day. | 8.00 |
| allow_hourly_leave_across_midnight | boolean | Y | Permit hourly leave to span midnight. | FALSE |
| hourly_leave_multiple_minutes | integer | N | Round to nearest N minutes. | 30 |
| hourly_leave_min_duration_minutes | integer | N | Minimum single application duration in minutes. | 30 |

**General configuration:**

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| restriction_logic | enum | Y | AND · OR — combination logic for restriction criteria. | AND |
| consider_final_work_duration | boolean | Y | Use final adjusted duration vs total raw duration. | TRUE |
| enable_nsd_multiplier | boolean | Y | Apply Night Shift Differential multiplier. | FALSE |
| enable_nsd_for_all_day_classes | boolean | Y | Apply NSD on weekday, weekly off, and holiday. | TRUE |
| nsd_multiplier_value | numeric(5,2) | N | E.g. 1.25 for 25% extra. | 1.25 |
| select_multiplication_factor | enum | Y | NSD_MULTIPLIER · INDEXING_RULE · FIXED. | NSD_MULTIPLIER |
| multiplying_factor_type | enum | Y | MULTIPLIER · INDEXING. | MULTIPLIER |
| use_contractual_hours_for_overtime | boolean | Y | Use contractual hours for OT calc vs shift hours. | FALSE |
| payroll_cycle_for_overtime_calc | enum | Y | PAYROLL_CYCLE · ATTENDANCE_CYCLE. | ATTENDANCE_CYCLE |
| overtime_limit_calc_basis | enum | Y | PAYROLL_CYCLE · ATTENDANCE_CYCLE. | ATTENDANCE_CYCLE |
| application_advance_notice_days | integer | Y | How far in advance OT must be planned. | 0 |
| max_future_application_days | integer | Y | How far ahead OT can be applied. | 30 |

**Day-class OT configuration (Weekdays / Weekly Off / Holidays) — common pattern:**

For each of the three day classes — Weekdays, Weekly Off, Holidays — the following sub-fields apply with day-class prefix (e.g. weekday_min_duration_minutes, weekly_off_min_duration_minutes, holiday_min_duration_minutes):

| **Sub-field** | **Type** | **Description** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| {day_class}_enable | boolean | Whether OT can accrue on this day class. |
| {day_class}_min_duration_minutes | integer | Minimum OT duration to consider. |
| {day_class}_min_working_hours_before_ot | numeric(4,2) | Weekdays only: minimum shift hours before OT counts. |
| {day_class}_requires_approval | boolean | Whether OT requires approval before counting. |
| {day_class}_approval_l1 | boolean | L1 manager approves. |
| {day_class}_approval_l2 | boolean | L2 manager approves. |
| {day_class}_approval_admin | boolean | Admin approves. |
| {day_class}_approval_flow_option | enum | STANDARD · EXCEPTIONAL · BOTH. |
| {day_class}_approval_flow_id | uuid | FK → workflows.id. |
| {day_class}_exceptional_flow_enabled | boolean | Define exceptional approval flow. |
| {day_class}_exceptional_flow_trigger_hours | numeric(5,2) | OT hours above which exceptional flow fires. |
| {day_class}_exceptional_flow_id | uuid | FK → workflows.id. |
| {day_class}_auto_reject_approve | enum | NONE · AUTO_APPROVE · AUTO_REJECT. |
| {day_class}_auto_action_days | integer | Days after which auto-action fires. |
| {day_class}_act_on_basis | enum | APPLIED_DATE · OT_DATE. |
| {day_class}_max_before_shift_minutes | integer | Weekdays only: cap on pre-shift OT. |
| {day_class}_max_after_shift_minutes | integer | Weekdays only: cap on post-shift OT. |
| {day_class}_limit_before_shift_to_zero | boolean | Force pre-shift OT = 0. |
| {day_class}_limit_after_shift_to_zero | boolean | Force post-shift OT = 0. |
| {day_class}_max_per_day_minutes | integer | Daily OT ceiling. |
| {day_class}_max_per_week_minutes | integer | Weekly OT ceiling. |
| {day_class}_max_per_month_minutes | integer | Monthly OT ceiling. |
| {day_class}_max_per_quarter_minutes | integer | Quarterly OT ceiling. |
| {day_class}_max_per_year_minutes | integer | Yearly OT ceiling. |
| {day_class}_grace_period_minutes | integer | Weekdays only: grace before OT counts. |
| {day_class}_min_ot_to_deduct_grace | integer | Min OT before grace deduction applies. |
| {day_class}_compoff_restriction | string(200) | Comp-off accrual restriction expression. |
| {day_class}_compoff_min_duration_accrue | integer | Min OT to accrue any comp-off. |
| {day_class}_compoff_min_for_one_day | integer | Min OT to accrue one full comp-off day. |
| {day_class}_compensation_via | enum | COMP_OFF · OVERTIME_PAY · BOTH. |
| {day_class}_deduction_minutes | integer | Deduction in minutes for specified OT hours. |
| {day_class}_deduction_hours | integer | OT hours to which deduction applies. |
| {day_class}_deduction_frequency | enum | PER_DAY · PER_WEEK · PER_MONTH. |
| {day_class}_rounding_direction | enum | UP · DOWN · NEAREST. |
| {day_class}_rounding_nearest_minutes | integer | Rounding granularity. |
| {day_class}_half_day_compoff_enabled | boolean | Credit half-day comp-off. |
| {day_class}_compoff_min_for_half_day | integer | Min OT for half-day comp-off. |
| {day_class}_allow_multiple_compoff_per_day | boolean | Allow > 1 comp-off accrual per day. |
| {day_class}_multiplier_enabled | boolean | Apply pay multiplier. |
| {day_class}_multiplier_value | numeric(5,2) | E.g. 1.5 for time-and-a-half. |
| {day_class}_nsd_multiplier_value | numeric(5,2) | Stacking NSD multiplier. |
| {day_class}_only_outside_shift | boolean | Weekdays only: count only time outside shift hours. |
| {day_class}_disallow_planned_in_shift | boolean | Weekdays only: don’t allow planned OT inside shift. |
| {day_class}_auto_approve_below_duration | integer | Auto-approve OT below N minutes. |
| {day_class}_use_dynamic_values_for_auto_approve | boolean | Compute auto-approve threshold dynamically. |
| {day_class}_allow_approver_edit_below_minimum | boolean | Approver can edit OT below threshold. |
| {day_class}_auto_approve_min_hours_if_rejected | boolean | Auto-approve min hours even if rejected/revoked. |
| {day_class}_override_compoff_lapse_days | boolean | Override default comp-off lapse days. |
| {day_class}_override_compoff_lapse_value | integer | Custom lapse days. |
| {day_class}_deductible_duration_auto_approve | integer | Auto-approve duration that is deductible. |
| {day_class}_do_not_generate_for | array(string) | Day-class exclusion list (e.g. specific shift codes). |

**Holiday-specific additional fields:**

| **Field** | **Type** | **Description** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| holiday_do_not_generate_on_national | boolean | Exclude National Holidays from OT generation. |
| holiday_enable_weekly_off_multiplier | boolean | Stack weekly-off multiplier on holiday. |
| holiday_weekly_off_multiplier | numeric(5,2) | Weekly off multiplier value. |
| holiday_off_day_multiplier | numeric(5,2) | Off day multiplier. |
| holiday_rest_day_multiplier | numeric(5,2) | Rest day multiplier. |
| holiday_enable_holiday_multiplier | boolean | Apply holiday multiplier on top. |
| holiday_holiday_multiplier | numeric(5,2) | Holiday multiplier value. |
| holiday_enable_national_holiday_multiplier | boolean | Apply National Holiday multiplier. |
| holiday_national_holiday_multiplier | numeric(5,2) | National Holiday multiplier value. |
| holiday_national_holiday_rest_day_multiplier | numeric(5,2) | National + Rest Day combo multiplier. |
| holiday_national_holiday_off_day_multiplier | numeric(5,2) | National + Off Day combo multiplier. |
| holiday_provide_additional_compoff_if_weekly_off | boolean | Extra comp-off if holiday falls on weekly off. |
| holiday_additional_compoff_count | integer | How many extra comp-offs. |
| holiday_additional_compoff_without_attendance | boolean | Grant additional even without attendance punch. |

**Cycle-based OT configuration (Weekly / Bi-Weekly / Monthly / Semi-Monthly):**

For each frequency, the following sub-fields apply with frequency prefix (e.g. weekly_starting_day, monthly_starting_day):

| **Sub-field** | **Type** | **Description** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| {freq}_enable | boolean | Whether cycle-based OT applies. |
| {freq}_starting_day | enum | Day of week or month to anchor cycle. |
| {freq}_overtime_after_hours | integer | OT triggers after N working hours in cycle. |
| {freq}_overtime_after_minutes | integer | Additional minutes after the hour threshold. |
| {freq}_multiplier | numeric(5,2) | Cycle-specific multiplier. |
| {freq}_consider_holidays | boolean | Include holiday hours in cycle total. |
| {freq}_deduction_minutes | integer | Deduction minutes. |
| {freq}_deduction_hours | integer | OT hours to which deduction applies. |
| {freq}_deduction_frequency | enum | PER_DAY · PER_WEEK · PER_MONTH. |
| {freq}_rounding_direction | enum | UP · DOWN · NEAREST. |
| {freq}_rounding_nearest_minutes | integer | Rounding granularity. |
| {freq}_compensation_via | enum | COMP_OFF · OVERTIME_PAY · BOTH. |
| {freq}_approval_flow_id | uuid | FK → workflows.id. |

**Combined Max OT (across all day classes):**

| **Field** | **Type** | **Description** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| enable_combined_max_ot | boolean | Cap combined OT across all classes. |
| combined_max_per_week | integer | Combined weekly max minutes. |
| combined_max_per_month | integer | Combined monthly max. |
| combined_max_per_quarter | integer | Combined quarterly max. |
| combined_max_per_year | integer | Combined yearly max. |

