| disallow_application_before_credited | boolean | Block applying before comp-off is credited. |
| allow_application_for_days_after_expiry | boolean | Honor application made for date before expiry, applied after. |
| allow_application_in_validity_period_after_expiry | boolean | Permit application during validity even after expiry. |
| push_all_compoff_to_admin | boolean | Bypass manager — route directly to admin. |
| auto_approve_days | integer | Auto-approve after N days. |
| compoff_credit_lapse_days | integer | Days after credit before comp-off lapses. |
