| clubbable_leave_list | array(uuid) | If WHITELIST. |
| allow_intermittent_encashment | boolean | Encash comp-off mid-cycle. |
| encash_type | enum | FULL · PARTIAL · CONFIGURED. |
| min_encash_balance | numeric(6,2) | Min to encash. |
| min_retained_after_encash | numeric(6,2) | Min to retain. |
| max_encashable_per_application | numeric(6,2) | Cap per application. |
| encash_amount_type | enum | BASIC · GROSS · CUSTOM_FORMULA. |
