| holiday_suffix_enabled | boolean | Holiday suffix enabled. |
| select_form_id | uuid | Optional custom form on application. |
| approval_flow_id | uuid | FK → workflows.id. |
| disable_cc_option | boolean | Block CC field on application. |
| enable_application_matrix | boolean | Use decision matrix. |
