### 4.6.4 attendance_records

Per-employee, per-date attendance. One row per day. Created by attendance lock job at end-of-day or by first punch event. LOP feed sent to Payroll (Phase 2) on payroll cutoff (25th of each month).

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| employee_id | uuid | Y | FK → employees.id. | — |
| attendance_date | date | Y | Local date. | — |
| shift_id | uuid | Y | FK → shifts.id. Effective shift for this date. | — |
| clock_in_time | timestamp (UTC) | N | First punch. | NULL |
| clock_in_method | enum | N | GPS · BIOMETRIC · APP_CHECK_IN · MANUAL · REGULARISATION. | NULL |
| clock_in_location_id | uuid | N | Geofence-resolved location. | NULL |
| clock_in_in_geofence | boolean | N | Whether clock-in was within configured geofence. | NULL |
| clock_out_time | timestamp (UTC) | N | Last punch. | NULL |
| clock_out_method | enum | N | Same enum as clock_in_method. | NULL |
| clock_out_location_id | uuid | N |  | NULL |
| work_duration_minutes | integer | N | Computed from clock_in and clock_out, minus breaks. | NULL |
| status | enum | Y | PRESENT · ABSENT · LEAVE · WEEKLY_OFF · HOLIDAY · OUT_DUTY · LOP · INCOMPLETE · ABSCONDING_DAY. | ABSENT |
| late_by_minutes | integer | N | Minutes past shift start. Zero grace time per policy. | NULL |
| early_out_minutes | integer | N | Minutes before shift end. | NULL |
| overtime_minutes | integer | N | Captured if planned OT was approved and worked. | NULL |
| is_locked | boolean | Y | TRUE after attendance period lock. Unlocking requires Attendance Admin or HR Admin. | FALSE |
| regularisation_application_id | uuid | N | Link to applied regularisation if status = PRESENT via regularisation. | NULL |
| out_duty_application_id | uuid | N | Link to Out Duty application if status = OUT_DUTY. | NULL |

**Sample data:**

| **employee** | **attendance_date** | **clock_in** | **clock_out** | **status** | **late_by_minutes** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| PSI000123 | 2026-05-20 | 09:32:14 | 18:35:02 | PRESENT | 2 |
| PSI000457 | 2026-05-20 | — | — | LEAVE | — |
| PSI000789 | 2026-05-20 | 10:15:00 | 19:00:00 | PRESENT | 45 |

