## 4.7 Onboarding Entities (M02)

Note — onboarding form catalog. The onboarding_form_data entity in this section is form-template-agnostic by design; it stores candidate-submitted values per the assigned form template. The configured onboarding forms — two candidate variants and seven workflow forms, their section structure, and the workflow stage each is tagged to — are registered in Appendix J — Onboarding Form Catalog.

### 4.6.8 attendance_platform_settings

Singleton entity holding tenant-wide attendance configuration. Drives platform defaults that policies and shifts can override.

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| attendance_platform_setting_id | uuid | Y | Primary key. | auto |
| tenant_id | uuid | Y | FK → tenants.id. Unique (one row per tenant). | — |

**Cluster 1 — Regularisation Restrictions:**

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| regularisation_restriction | enum | Y | NONE · FIXED_DATE_RANGE · CYCLE_END_DAYS · PER_POLICY. | PER_POLICY |
| regularisation_fixed_from | date | N | If FIXED_DATE_RANGE. | NULL |
| regularisation_fixed_to | date | N | If FIXED_DATE_RANGE. | NULL |
| regularisation_cycle_end_days | integer | N | If CYCLE_END_DAYS. | NULL |

**Cluster 2 — Cron Jobs ****&**** Auto-Actions:**

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| auto_approve_attendance_monthly_cron_date | integer | N | Day of month for auto-approve cron. | NULL |
| act_on_attendance_requests_basis | enum | Y | APPLIED_DATE · REQUEST_DATE. | APPLIED_DATE |
| include_revoke_in_auto_approval | boolean | Y | Include revoke requests. | FALSE |
| include_clockin_in_other_requests | boolean | Y | Bundle clock-in requests with other types. | TRUE |
| reject_pending_via_date_cron | boolean | Y | Auto-reject pending requests. | FALSE |
| reject_pending_ot_via_date_cron | boolean | Y | Auto-reject pending OT. | FALSE |

**Cluster 3 — SLA Escalation:**

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| enable_escalation | boolean | Y | Escalate stale attendance requests. | TRUE |
| escalation_days | integer | N | Days before escalation fires. | 3 |
| escalate_to_role | enum | N | LEVEL_2_MANAGER · HRBP · HR_ADMIN. | LEVEL_2_MANAGER |
| push_all_requests_to_admin | boolean | Y | Bypass manager — admin only. | FALSE |

**Cluster 4 — Mandatory/Display Toggles:**

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| make_message_non_mandatory | boolean | Y | Free-text message optional. | FALSE |
| make_reason_non_mandatory | boolean | Y | Reason selection optional. | FALSE |
| allow_revoke_approved_requests | boolean | Y | Allow revocation of approved requests. | TRUE |
| allow_revoke_past_dated_approved | boolean | Y | Allow past-dated revocations. | FALSE |
| reject_reason_mandatory | boolean | Y | Mandate rejection reason. | TRUE |

**Cluster 5 — Present Day Exclusions:**

For each calculation type (Work Duration, Late By, Early Out), three exclusion toggles:

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| exclude_days_from_work_duration | boolean | Y | Apply exclusions on work duration calc. | TRUE |
| work_duration_exclude_weekly_off | boolean | Y | Weekly off excluded. | TRUE |
| work_duration_exclude_holiday | boolean | Y | Holiday excluded. | TRUE |
| work_duration_exclude_leave | boolean | Y | Leave excluded. | TRUE |
| exclude_days_from_late_by | boolean | Y | Apply exclusions on Late By calc. | TRUE |
| late_by_exclude_weekly_off | boolean | Y |  | TRUE |
| late_by_exclude_holiday | boolean | Y |  | TRUE |
| late_by_exclude_leave | boolean | Y |  | TRUE |
| exclude_days_from_early_out | boolean | Y | Apply exclusions on Early Out calc. | TRUE |
| early_out_exclude_weekly_off | boolean | Y |  | TRUE |
| early_out_exclude_holiday | boolean | Y |  | TRUE |
| early_out_exclude_leave | boolean | Y |  | TRUE |

**Cluster 6 — Weekly Limit Anchoring:**

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| first_day_of_week_for_weekly_limits | enum | Y | SUN · MON · TUE · WED · THU · FRI · SAT. | MON |

**Cluster 7 — Infraction Framework (new — FR-M05-009):**

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| enable_infraction_framework | boolean | Y | Activate infraction tracking. | FALSE |
| use_points_system_in_infraction | boolean | Y | Use points-based calculation. | FALSE |
| consider_weekly_off_for_absconding | boolean | Y | Include W-Off in absconding count. | FALSE |
| consider_holiday_for_absconding | boolean | Y | Include holidays. | FALSE |
| consider_system_deducted_leave_for_absconding | boolean | Y | Include system-deducted leave. | FALSE |
| do_not_consider_pending_leave_for_absconding | boolean | Y | Exclude pending leave. | TRUE |
| do_not_consider_pending_request_for_absconding | boolean | Y | Exclude pending requests. | TRUE |
| enable_auto_process_attendance_adjacent_days | boolean | Y | Auto-process attendance on adjacent days when changes occur. | TRUE |

**Cluster 8 — Conflict Rules:**

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| disallow_attendance_and_leave_same_day | boolean | Y | Prevent simultaneous attendance + leave applications. | TRUE |
| include_hourly_leave_in_restriction | boolean | Y | Apply restriction to hourly leave. | TRUE |
| include_half_day_leave_in_restriction | boolean | Y | Apply restriction to half-day leave. | TRUE |
| include_short_leave_in_restriction | boolean | Y | Apply restriction to short leave. | TRUE |
| include_out_duty_in_restriction | boolean | Y | Apply restriction to out duty. | TRUE |
| enable_directionality_at_user_level | boolean | Y | Track In/Out punch directionality per user. | FALSE |

**Cluster 9 — Punch Reminders:**

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| enable_last_punch_warning | boolean | Y | Warn if last punch missing. | TRUE |
| enable_last_punch_reminder_for_all | boolean | Y | Send reminder to all employees. | FALSE |
| enable_uag_in_reason_master | boolean | Y | Allow UAG-scoped reasons. | TRUE |
| enable_extended_attendance_settings | boolean | Y | Activate Extended settings menu. | FALSE |
| disable_bulk_regularisation | boolean | Y | Block bulk reg uploads. | FALSE |

**Cluster 10 — Manager Notifications:**

