### 4.7.1 onboarding_processes

Onboarding process configuration. Defines the workflow, forms, document clusters, and BGV package assignment for a candidate. Auto-initiation can fire 14 days before DOJ (per migrated config).

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Validation / Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| process_name | string(120) | Y | e.g. “BGV Form Standard”. | — |
| applicability_employment_types | json array | Y | Array of employment types this process applies to. | [] |
| onboarding_form_template_id | uuid | Y | FK → form_templates.id. | — |
| onboarding_workflow_id | uuid | Y | FK → workflows.id. | — |
| bgv_package_id | uuid | N | FK → bgv_packages.id. Optional. | NULL |
| welcome_page_template_id | uuid | N | FK → letter_templates.id. | NULL |
| auto_initiation_enabled | boolean | Y | Default TRUE per migrated config. | TRUE |
| auto_initiation_basis | enum | Y | DOJ · DATE_ADDED_TO_PENDING. | DOJ |
| auto_initiation_days_before | integer | Y | Days before trigger date. Default 14. | 14 |
| auto_completion_enabled | boolean | Y | Default FALSE — explicit admin completion preserved. | FALSE |
| status | enum | Y | ACTIVE · INACTIVE. | ACTIVE |

**Sample data:**

| **process_name** | **auto_initiation_days_before** | **status** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Full-Time Standard Onboarding | 14 | ACTIVE |
| Contract Onboarding | 7 | ACTIVE |
| Intern Onboarding | 3 | ACTIVE |

