| checks_included | json array | Y | Array of check codes: ID_VERIFICATION · ADDRESS · EDUCATION · EMPLOYMENT · CRIMINAL · CREDIT · DRUG_TEST · REFERENCE. | [] |
| status | enum | Y | ACTIVE · INACTIVE. | ACTIVE |

