## 4.9 Recruitment Entities (M08)

**Single source of truth (M08). **Offer status is owned by offer_lifecycle_state (§4.9.18) and the §8.7a Offer Lifecycle State Machine; offers.approval_status and offers.candidate_acceptance_status (§4.9.5) are derived sub-statuses. Per-channel job posting and scheduling are owned by job_postings (§4.9.16). The candidate lifecycle is owned by the §8.6 Candidate State Machine. Where an older inline field or enum overlaps these, the referenced target is authoritative.

### 4.9.1 requisitions

Job requisitions with expanded attributes.

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| requisition_id | uuid | Y | Primary key. | auto |
| requisition_number | string(40) | Y | Auto-generated. | — |
