| ctc_currency | string(3) | N | ISO 4217. | “INR” |
| employment_type | enum | Y | FULL_TIME · PART_TIME · CONTRACT · CONSULTANT · INTERN. | FULL_TIME |
| work_type | enum | N | ONSITE · REMOTE · HYBRID. | ONSITE |
