### 4.9.5 offers

Offer letter records with extended attributes. Offer status is owned by offer_lifecycle_state (§4.9.18) and the §8.7a Offer Lifecycle State Machine; the approval_status and candidate_acceptance_status fields below are derived sub-statuses of that lifecycle.

