| offer_lifecycle_state | enum | Y | PENDING_FOR_APPROVAL · APPROVED_TO_SHARE_WITH_CANDIDATE · PENDING_WITH_CANDIDATE · ACCEPTED_TO_PENDING_LIST · IN_PENDING_LIST · EMPLOYEE_MOVEMENT_INITIATED · EMPLOYEE_MOVEMENT_APPROVED · REJECTED · COMPLETED · EXPIRED. | PENDING_FOR_APPROVAL |
| position_ref | string(40) | N | {JR_code}:{position_no} the offer fills. | NULL |
| pay_structure_mode | enum | Y | OLD · NEW (Choose Salary Structure). | OLD |
| pay_scale_group_id | uuid | N | FK → pay scale group. | NULL |
| salary_structure_id | uuid | N | FK → salary structure. | NULL |
| show_total_ctc_in_breakup | boolean | Y | Show Total CTC in Salary Breakup. | FALSE |
