| allow_employee_exclusion | boolean | Y | Allow excluding employees from this review (FR-M09 — exclusions). | TRUE |
| exclusion_reasons_list | array(uuid) | N | FK → review_exclusions reasons. | [] |
| display_letter_grade_in_review | boolean | Y | Display letter grade alongside numeric. | FALSE |
| letter_grade_mapping | jsonb | N | {range_from, range_to, letter}. | NULL |

*Relationships: Many-to-many with employees via review_assignments. One-to-many with review_stage_field_permissions, custom_formulas (when used), calibration_configurations.*

### 4.10.13 review_stage_field_permissions

Granular per-stage × per-field × per-persona permission matrix. Drives stage-specific UI rendering.

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| stage_field_permission_id | uuid | Y | Primary key. | auto |
| review_template_id | uuid | Y | FK → review_templates.id. | — |
| stage_code | enum | Y | SELF · MANAGER · SKIP · PEER · SUB · CUST · COMM · MOD · CAL · FINAL. | — |
| field_code | enum | Y | Reference to a parameter or field within the review (Goals · Competencies · OverallRating · Comments · Strengths · etc.). | — |
| visible_to_persona | jsonb | Y | Per-persona visibility map. | {EMPLOYEE: true, MANAGER: true, HRBP: true, ADMIN: true} |
| editable_by_persona | jsonb | Y | Per-persona editability map. | {EMPLOYEE: false, MANAGER: true, HRBP: false, ADMIN: false} |
| mandatory_for_persona | jsonb | Y | Per-persona mandatory map. | {EMPLOYEE: false, MANAGER: false, HRBP: false, ADMIN: false} |
| max_length_chars | integer | N | Char limit for text fields at this stage. | NULL |
| min_length_chars | integer | N | Char minimum. | NULL |
| previous_stage_value_visible | jsonb | Y | Whether prior stages’ values display. | {SELF: false, MANAGER: true} |

*Relationships: Composite unique on (review_template_id, stage_code, field_code). Many-to-one with review_templates.*

