| override_audit_log_visible | boolean | Y | Show override audit to participants. | TRUE |

**Normalization cluster:**

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| apply_normalization_pre_calibration | boolean | Y | Apply normalization before manual calibration. | TRUE |
| normalization_basis | enum | Y | DEPARTMENT · LOCATION · GRADE · UAG · GLOBAL. | DEPARTMENT |
| normalization_method | enum | Y | BELL_CURVE · IDEAL_DISTRIBUTION · Z_SCORE · PERCENTILE. | IDEAL_DISTRIBUTION |
| normalization_rule_id | uuid | N | FK → normalization_rules.id. | NULL |

**Ideal Distribution cluster** (when method=IDEAL_DISTRIBUTION):

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| ideal_distribution_pct | jsonb | N | Per-rating-band target percentages, e.g. {“E”:10,“VG”:20,“G”:40,“NI”:20,“U”:10}. | NULL |
| tolerance_pct | numeric(5,2) | N | Tolerance for deviation from ideal. | 5.00 |
| auto_adjust_to_ideal | boolean | Y | System auto-adjusts marginal ratings. | FALSE |

**N-Grid Display cluster:**

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| enable_n_grid | boolean | Y | Use 9-Box / N-Grid display. | FALSE |
| n_grid_x_axis | enum | N | PERFORMANCE · POTENTIAL · CONTRIBUTION · CUSTOM. | PERFORMANCE |
| n_grid_y_axis | enum | N | POTENTIAL · PERFORMANCE · GROWTH · CUSTOM. | POTENTIAL |
| n_grid_x_field_code | enum | N | If X-axis is custom: specific parameter code. | NULL |
| n_grid_y_field_code | enum | N | If Y-axis is custom: specific parameter code. | NULL |
| n_grid_cells | integer | Y | 4 (2x2), 9 (3x3), 16 (4x4), 25 (5x5). | 9 |
| n_grid_cell_labels | jsonb | N | Per-cell labels (e.g. {“1_1”:“Future Leader”,“3_3”:“PIP”}). | NULL |
| n_grid_cell_colors | jsonb | N | Per-cell color hex codes. | NULL |
| allow_drag_drop_in_grid | boolean | Y | Permit drag-and-drop to move employee between cells. | TRUE |
| capture_reason_on_grid_move | boolean | Y | Mandate reason on cell move. | TRUE |

**Other configuration:**

| **Field** | **Type** | **Required** | **Description** | **Default** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
