| max_participants_per_session | integer | Y | Cap on participants. | 50 |
| session_duration_minutes | integer | N | Default session length. | 90 |
| allow_async_calibration | boolean | Y | Permit async (non-meeting) calibration. | TRUE |
| async_calibration_deadline_days | integer | N | Deadline in days for async. | 7 |
| publish_calibrated_ratings_to_employee | boolean | Y | Auto-publish on calibration close. | TRUE |
| publish_requires_manager_acknowledgement | boolean | Y | Manager must acknowledge before publish. | TRUE |
| generate_calibration_report | boolean | Y | Auto-generate post-session report. | TRUE |

*Relationships: Many-to-one with review_templates. References normalization_rules.*

