| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| policy_name | string(200) | Y |  | — |
| category_id | uuid | Y | FK → policy_categories.id. | — |
| current_version | integer | Y | Up to 10 versions retained on hot storage. | 1 |
| file_path | string(500) | Y | Object storage path. | — |
| file_size_bytes | integer | Y | Max 25 MB per file. | — |
| mime_type | string(100) | Y | Whitelist enforced. | — |
| effective_from | date | Y |  | — |
| effective_to | date | N |  | NULL |
| requires_acknowledgement | boolean | Y | If TRUE, sign-off engine drives acknowledgement tracking. | TRUE |
| allow_decline | boolean | Y | If TRUE, employees can decline with mandatory reason. | FALSE |
| visibility_rule | json | Y | Scope rule: ALL_EMPLOYEES · BY_DEPARTMENT · BY_GRADE · BY_EMPLOYMENT_TYPE · BY_LOCATION. | {“scope”:“ALL_EMPLOYEES”} |
| form_tagging_enabled | boolean | Y | Whether a form is attached before sign-off. | FALSE |
| form_template_id | uuid | N | FK → form_templates.id. | NULL |
| status | enum | Y | DRAFT · PUBLISHED · ARCHIVED. | DRAFT |

