### 4.14.4 audit_log

Immutable data audit log. Written by database-level trigger — not application code. No application bug, developer action, or API bypass can suppress an audit entry. The audit log table has no UPDATE or DELETE permission granted to any database user, except for the system-initiated PII redaction under the right-to-erasure workflow.

