| record_id | uuid | Y | Primary key of the mutated row. | — |
| operation | enum | Y | INSERT · UPDATE · SOFT_DELETE. | — |
| field_name | string(120) | N | Set on UPDATE. NULL on INSERT/SOFT_DELETE. | NULL |
| old_value | text (masked for PII) | N | PII fields stored in masked form only. | NULL |
| new_value | text (masked for PII) | N | PII fields stored in masked form only. | NULL |
| changed_by_user_id | uuid | Y | FK → users.id. SYSTEM user for scheduled jobs. | — |
| changed_at | timestamp (UTC) | Y |  | now() |
| ip_address | string(50) | Y | Client IP. | — |
| user_agent | string(500) | Y | Client user-agent string. | — |
| redacted_at | timestamp (UTC) | N | Set when right-to-erasure overwrites PII value with redaction marker. Only permitted mutation of audit log. | NULL |

