| DA13 | Payroll-window notification | On the 24th and 25th of every month, the system sends a pending attendance request notification to the responsible Manager every 2 hours until all pending requests are resolved. Overrides the standard 5-day escalation cadence on those two days only. Applies to: check-in requests · regularisation · out duty · planned overtime · overnight outside-fence punch. Shift change requests are admin-initiate | Apr 2026 |
| DA14 | Overnight last punch | When an employee is marked absent on day D and clocks in on day D+1, the system presents a choice: new clock-in or overnight last punch. If overnight last punch and within geofence: auto-update day D record. If outside geofence: route to Manager (L1) for approval before updating day D record. 32-day back-dating limit applies (matching ATPY_4/ATPY_5 back-dating window). | Apr 2026 |
