| BIOMETRIC_DEVICE_OFFLINE | Device heartbeat missed for > configured threshold | IN_APP + EMAIL | Attendance Admin · IT Admin | Device id, location, last heartbeat timestamp |
| ATTENDANCE_LOCK_FIRED | Period lock job completes | IN_APP | Attendance Admin · HR Admin | Locked period summary; unlock requires admin action |

